#: kamarada-firstboot.ui.h:1
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Back"

#: kamarada-firstboot.ui.h:2
msgid "Try Linux Kamarada"
msgstr "Try Linux Kamarada"

#: kamarada-firstboot.ui.h:3
msgid "Install Linux Kamarada"
msgstr "Install Linux Kamarada"

#: kamarada-firstboot.ui.h:4
msgid ""
"You can try Linux Kamarada without making any changes to your computer, "
"directly from this live medium."
msgstr ""
"You can try Linux Kamarada without making any changes to your computer, "
"directly from this live medium."

#: kamarada-firstboot.ui.h:5
msgid ""
"Or, if you're ready, you can install Linux Kamarada alongside (or instead "
"of) your current operating system."
msgstr ""
"Or, if you're ready, you can install Linux Kamarada alongside (or instead "
"of) your current operating system."
